

## 1. Page Layout (UI Design)
- **Header:** Consistent navigation bar ("Explore Nepal - Travel Inquiry").
- **Inquiry Form Card:** Centered, clean form box containing:
  - **Full Name** (Text input, required)
  - **Email Address** (Email input, required)
  - **Phone / WhatsApp Number** (Optional text input)
  - **Interested Destination / Region** (Dropdown: Kathmandu, Pokhara, Everest, Chitwan, Lumbini, Other)
  - **Preferred Travel Month / Date** (Date or text input)
  - **Your Question / Travel Details** (Multi-line text area, required)
  - **Submit Inquiry Button** (Primary action button)
- **Confirmation Banner:** Success message displayed after submission ("Thank you! Your inquiry has been received with status: New.").

## 2. Inquiry Data Structure
Each submitted inquiry stores:
- **Inquiry ID:** Unique identifier
- **Visitor Name:** Full name of the user
- **Email:** Contact email address
- **Destination:** Selected Nepal region
- **Message:** Visitor's travel question
- **Status:** Default set to `New` (connects to Admin Inquiry Review workflow)
